 select '7f123dae-1f7e-47e4-a893-b31d112226ab', '28c2b0a4-e59b-452a-a2e8-bfc07162bad0', 2, 2, 'The counters (In progress, Waiting, Delivered, Closed) and chips (All, Needs action, Delivered) filter the list. "Needs action" means M-Core is waiting on you or work was delivered for your check.', 'Kaunter (Proses, Tunggu, Dihantar, Ditutup) dan cip (Semua, Perlu tindakan, Dihantar) menapis senarai. "Perlu tindakan" bermaksud M-Core menunggu anda atau kerja sudah dihantar untuk semakan anda.', NULL, NULL, 'servis_saya', 'lc-img/sd_client/my-services-2.webp', 'Example screen (sample data): The counters (In progress, Waiting, Delivered, Closed) and chips (All, Needs action, Delivered) filter the list. "Needs action" means M-Core', 'Contoh skrin (data contoh): Kaunter (Proses, Tunggu, Dihantar, Ditutup) dan cip (Semua, Perlu tindakan, Dihantar) menapis senarai. "Perlu tindakan" bermaksud M-Core men'
